<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4 Case Studies ‣ Struct-Bench: A Benchmark for Differentially Private Structured Text Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Problem 2: Semantic diversity (KNN-Recall) is low.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4 Case Studies ‣ Struct-Bench: A Benchmark for Differentially Private Structured Text Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Solution 2: Node extraction &amp; auto-generation can improve semantic diversity.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 4 Case Studies ‣ Struct-Bench: A Benchmark for Differentially Private Structured Text Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Combination of our solutions achieves the best performance on most metrics.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
