<p id="A2.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Illustration of the data modeling of ShareGPT</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">We illustrate the data modeling of ShareGPT in <a href="#A2.F10" title="In B.1 Examples on ShareGPT ‣ Appendix B Data Modeling and Evaluation Items of Each Dataset ‣ Struct-Bench: A Benchmark for Differentially Private Structured Text Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Fig.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>.</p>
</div>
