<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Benchmarking DP Synthetic Data Generation with Varying Privacy Budget</h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We illustrate the performance of PE and DP-FT on all metrics under different privacy budgets <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon\in\left\{1,2,4,\infty\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon\in\left\{1,2,4,\infty\right\}</annotation></semantics></math> on ShareGPT and ICLR datasets by radar plots in <a href="#A3.F11" title="In C.2 Benchmarking DP Synthetic Data Generation with Varying Privacy Budget ‣ Appendix C Additional Results on Struct-Bench ‣ Struct-Bench: A Benchmark for Differentially Private Structured Text Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figs.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> and <a href="#A3.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ C.2 Benchmarking DP Synthetic Data Generation with Varying Privacy Budget ‣ Appendix C Additional Results on Struct-Bench ‣ Struct-Bench: A Benchmark for Differentially Private Structured Text Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>. Similar to <a href="#A3.SS1" title="C.1 Benchmarking DP Synthetic Data Generation Across Datasets ‣ Appendix C Additional Results on Struct-Bench ‣ Struct-Bench: A Benchmark for Differentially Private Structured Text Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>, we use GPT-2 for FT and DP-FT, and use GPT-4o for IF and PE.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.F11" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<figure id="A3.F11.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.10696v1/radar.svg" id="A3.F11.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/340;" width="476" height="340"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A3.F11.sf1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(a)</span> </span><math id="A3.F11.sf1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon=\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">ϵ</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon=\infty</annotation></semantics></math></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<figure id="A3.F11.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.10696v1/radar_eps4.svg" id="A3.F11.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/340;" width="476" height="340"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A3.F11.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><math id="A3.F11.sf2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon=4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">ϵ</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon=4</annotation></semantics></math></figcaption>
