7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">The</span><span id="lstnumberx19.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx19.39" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_lst_keywords2 ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">format</span><span id="lstnumberx19.40" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx19.41" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">should</span><span id="lstnumberx19.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx19.43" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">be</span><span id="lstnumberx19.44" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">:</span>
