span id="lstnumberx32.18.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>you?<span id="lstnumberx32.18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>I’m<span id="lstnumberx32.18.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>fine."</span><span id="lstnumberx32.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx32.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">You</span><span id="lstnumberx32.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx32.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">should</span><span id="lstnumberx32.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx32.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">reformat</span><span id="lstnumberx32.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx32.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">it</span><span id="lstnumberx32.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx32.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">as</span><span id="lstnumberx32.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx32.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_string ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">"HUMAN:<span id="lstnumberx32.30.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>How<span id="lstnumberx32.30.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>are<span id="lstnumberx32.30.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>you?<span id="lstnumberx32.30.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>GPT:<span id="lstnumberx32.30.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>I’m<span id="lstnumberx32.30.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>fine."</span>
